#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9729 expect=noViolation domain=TE
#note "DISCRIMINATOR (R-5.26): the TEENRL column EXISTS (blank on every row), so the not var_exists(\"TEENRL\") leaf is false and the sister stays silent - this dataset is PMDA-SD0089-A's state (TEDUR absent, TEENRL to populate), and that sibling reports the blank rows at their locations. The sister answers only for the neither-column state."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TE label="Trial Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col TESTRL  type=Char label="Rule for Start of Element"
col TEENRL  type=Char label="Rule for End of Element"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | SCRN | Screening | Informed consent |
CDISCPILOT01 | TE | TRT | Treatment | First dose |
